                        "source_sense_id": "6540019e-f0f9-39a2-a250-6a7dcabdfdaa",
                        "source_sense_description": "bepaalde soort kraaiachtige vogel, Corvus frugilegus",
                        "target_lang_word": "Saatkrähe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Saatkrähe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdd92fce-1c1f-371c-846b-1757ccdaace8",
                                        "entry_id": "042fc893-f33e-3b26-8603-6dbc3ae6681e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Singvogel der Familie der Rabenvögel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c57e80fd-6ced-4405-acc1-858ededd28ee",
                                                "sense_id": "fdd92fce-1c1f-371c-846b-1757ccdaace8",
                                                "text": "In Deutschland treten Saatkrähen im Winter in großen Trupps auf, im Sommer sind sie selten zu sehen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27222e2e-3725-4f99-827f-5d5cce926068",
                                                "sense_id": "fdd92fce-1c1f-371c-846b-1757ccdaace8",
                                                "text": "„Die Landräte und die Polizeiverwaltungen in den Städten sollten die Wildbrethändler auf die mögliche Jagd von Saatkrähen hinweisen und ihren vorschlagen, Anzeigen in Zeitungen zu veröffentlichen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "348c89e7-7182-4951-bf06-b74db0b822f2",
                                                "sense_id": "fdd92fce-1c1f-371c-846b-1757ccdaace8",
                                                "text": "„Vorhin habe ich gelernt, dass die Saaatkrähe im Unterschied zur Nebelkrähe zerzauste Hosen, einen nackten Schnabelansatz und erzfarbenes Gefieder hat.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66cd2b43-49d6-47e4-aa8f-1d2640d674aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "000d19fd-95a4-37a5-8fa8-8040346b630c",
                        "source_sense_id": "6540019e-f0f9-39a2-a250-6a7dcabdfdaa",
                        "source_sense_description": "bepaalde soort kraaiachtige vogel, Corvus frugilegus",
                        "target_lang_word": "rook",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rook",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d7b8fbb-f896-3766-b508-957373e103fe",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A European bird, Corvus frugilegus, of the crow family."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92ee5a16-476b-41e7-aa3f-9f3e4474326c",
                                                "sense_id": "6d7b8fbb-f896-3766-b508-957373e103fe",
                                                "text": "But what distinguishes the rook from the crow is the bill; the nostrils, chin, and sides of that and the mouth being in old birds white and bared of feathers, by often thrusting the bill into the ground in search of the erucæ of the Dor-beetle*; the rook then, instead of being proscribed, should be treated as the farmer's friend; as it clears his ground from caterpillars, that do incredible damage by eating the roots of the corn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b6a8054-a8b0-4604-88ab-69c618fff377",
                                                "sense_id": "6d7b8fbb-f896-3766-b508-957373e103fe",
                                                "text": "To-night the winds begin to rise\n⁠And roar from yonder dropping day:\n⁠The last red leaf is whirl’d away,\nThe rooks are blown about the skies; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e5c2039-acfd-3653-8ac5-4fccf78bd50c",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cheat or swindler; someone who betrays."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a15ba337-0445-4f2a-83b6-7fc976c19137",
                                                "sense_id": "1e5c2039-acfd-3653-8ac5-4fccf78bd50c",
                                                "text": "So I am (like an old rook, who is ruined by gaming) forced to live on the good fortune of the pushing young men, whose fancies are so vigorous that they ensure their success in their adventures with Muses, by their strength and imagination."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60f80622-6e3b-31ac-b221-f665bb1c1c1f",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bad deal; a rip-off."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aefc8b86-89d9-35d0-b134-050eaf7f3cd3",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of firecracker used by farmers to scare birds of the same name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8a1ce7c-dcb0-3c27-a06d-b8c73bd87b88",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trick-taking game, usually played with a specialized deck of cards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bcd0361-cdc4-4dd5-91d1-720411e2ea32",
                                                "sense_id": "f8a1ce7c-dcb0-3c27-a06d-b8c73bd87b88",
                                                "text": "Adventists still do not really know how to play cards, apart from the sanitized version of bridge, Rook."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54189713-64cc-3e23-ac37-8b80fba1af07",
                                        "entry_id": "bc274fc7-101a-3d5d-8882-7c95ef193ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A parson."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
